Insert a Comment into Your Report
Type in two hyphens -- to start a comment which extends to the end of the line.
Remarks
The comments will be ignored when generating the HTML page, meaning they do not affect the look of
the HTML page. The comment is not part of the .htm file when you save the HtmlReport.
This text will be displayed. -- This text will not be displayed.
The result looks like this:
