Insert a Horizontal Line
Type in three hyphens ---, which are not followed by text, to create a solid horizontal line.
Remarks
You can also type more than three hyphens. If you type in other characters than the hyphens into the line
of characters, Plant Simulation interprets --- as the start of a comment.
Text above the line.
------
Text below the line.
--- This is a comment ---
